  "description": "The meme relies on a misogynistic stereotype that implies women are foolish or incompetent, using the derogatory metaphor of 'goat' to belittle the woman's perceived intelligence or self-perception. This stereotype is part of a broader pattern of misogyny that denies women's competence and intellectual capacity, often mocking their self-confidence or perceived arrogance.",
